      "html": "<ul><li>A home or small business battery install is notifiable electrical work under BS 7671 and Part P.</li><li>The grid operator must be told: G98 for small single-premises systems within the limits, G99 above them.</li><li>The record covers the DC and AC install, isolation, siting, ventilation, fire separation and the commissioning tests.</li><li>Quickler records the evidence. It does not make a battery safe.</li></ul>"
